  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Async Scan Lifecycle",
      "items": [
        "POST /api/scan checks ownership + VERIFIED status, then returns 202 {scan_id}",
        "Pipeline runs fire-and-forget in-process; status lives only in MongoDB",
        "Findings persist incrementally per source; a 90s soft deadline yields PARTIAL, never a false clean result",
        "Dashboard polls GET /api/scan/:id every 2s while sources report progress"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Fetch Guard & Evidence Tiers",
      "items": [
        "Budgets: ≤10 pages/scan · ≤512KB/page · 10s/page · 30s/connector",
        "SSRF checks reject private-network and file:// targets; login-walled domains are denylisted",
        "A blocked or failed fetch downgrades to snippet-tier evidence instead of dropping the lead",
        "Broker exposure = a discovered result whose domain matches brokers.json (no crawling)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Trust Boundaries",
      "items": [
        "Unverified identifiers can never be scanned; every route is scoped by the session user",
        "External content is untrusted input — page text is data, never instructions",
        "Raw page text stays on-host: GLiNER runs at 127.0.0.1; the cloud LLM is not in the extraction path",
        "Gemini sees a redacted finding schema — never raw PII; a deterministic template is the fallback",
        "Name-only similarity caps at POTENTIAL and can never confirm a match"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "External Dependencies & Ops",
      "items": [
        "Serper.dev: ≤6 queries/scan; an HMAC-keyed TTL cache (6h) protects the free-tier quota",
        "ExposedOrNot is keyless; an outage records the source unavailable, never faked",
        "Resend delivers 6-digit verification codes; dev mode prints them to the server console",
        "docker compose runs app + sidecar + mongo (single-node replSet for transactions)",
        "GLiNER weights are baked into the sidecar image; /api/health probes Mongo and the sidecar"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Deterministic Core & Monitoring",
      "items": [
        "Correlation, severity, and priority are versioned rules — every exposure stamps rule_version",
        "Fingerprints drive ACTIVE → NOT_FOUND → REAPPEARED / REMEDIATED across re-scans",
        "Auto-close after 3 consecutive NOT_FOUND scans keeps findings from accumulating",
        "DELETE /api/account erases identifiers, scans, and exposures in one transaction (DPDP)"
      ]
    }
  ]
